# GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2 — react-router 7.x "RSC Mode CSRF Bypass Allows Action
# Execution". Requires React Server Components mode (server actions); this
# dashboard is a pure client-side Vite SPA (BrowserRouter, no SSR/RSC), so the
# vulnerable code path cannot execute. The real fix is react-router 8.3.0,
# which requires React >=19.2 — tracked in docs/backlog.md as the React 19
# upgrade. Remove this entry when that lands.
